        "Description": "Everything begins here.\r\rThree senior intelligence officials have spent years using their positions to shield the Harmonium from scrutiny. Whenever investigations drew too close, these individuals intervened. Leads disappeared. Witnesses were discredited. Cases were quietly closed.\r\rUntil recently, we had no evidence linking them to the organization.\r\rToday, all three targets are attending what appears to be a routine training exercise at the ICA Facility. In reality, the meeting serves as",
